# Analysis of the challenge structure.
#
# Observations:
# - key = os.urandom(32) (secret), base_nonce = os.urandom(9) (secret), seed = 64-bit (secret, nonzero).
# - shifts[4] derived from shake_256(base_nonce).digest(5): material[1..4], num = material[0]&1.
