#   But we don't know base_nonce... however shifts/num only depend on base_nonce via shake_256(base_nonce).digest(5).
#   base_nonce is 9 random bytes = 72 bits. Can't brute force directly.
#
# - nonce = base_nonce || (state & 0xFFFFFF) where state = T^x(seed), T = transform (GF(2)-linear, invertible?).
